# eslint-snapshot-rule-tester format: v1


Test: quadrant-no-invalid-color >> invalid >>> docs/rules/quadrant-no-invalid-color.md incorrect 1
Filename: quadrant-no-invalid-color-incorrect-1.mmd

Code:
  1 | quadrantChart
  2 |   Point A: [0.3, 0.5] color: f00, radius: 12
    |                              ^~~ [1]
  3 |

Output:
  1 | quadrantChart
  2 |   Point A: [0.3, 0.5] color: #f00, radius: 12
  3 |

[1] mermaid.js accepts `f00` as a colour but writes it into the drawing as it is, which browsers do not read, so the colour is not drawn.
---


